WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.780
I'm very sorry to say this, that Brazil is doing poorly

00:03.780 --> 00:06.380
and will continue to do poorly.

00:06.380 --> 00:11.420
They can only do well when they're working with us.

00:11.420 --> 00:14.320
Without us, they will fail, just as others have failed.

00:14.320 --> 00:14.940
It's true.

00:14.940 --> 00:17.040
Next year, the United States will celebrate

00:17.040 --> 00:21.100
the 250th anniversary of our glorious independence,

00:21.100 --> 00:25.340
a testament to enduring power and American freedom and spirit.

00:25.340 --> 00:30.980
We will also be proudly hosting the 2026 FIFA World Cup

00:30.980 --> 00:33.960
and shortly thereafter the 2028 Olympics,

00:33.960 --> 00:35.180
which is going to be very exciting.

00:35.180 --> 00:36.640
I hope you all come.

00:36.640 --> 00:39.100
I hope that countless people from all over the globe

00:39.100 --> 00:41.500
will take part in these greats.

00:41.500 --> 00:44.180
These will be great celebrations of liberty

00:44.180 --> 00:47.760
and human achievement, and that together we all can rejoice

00:47.760 --> 00:50.540
in the miracles of history that began in July 4th.

